/.idea/
/node_modules/
/JavaConcepts.iml
/out/

# The package files carry the project workflow (npm run revise / approve / audit),
# so they must be tracked for the project to be reproducible from a clone.

# Java compiled output - never commit .class files
**/*.class

# The proposal written by `npm run revise` while a review is open. It is cleared
# as soon as the changes are applied or discarded, and it describes a state that
# only exists between those two moments.
/revision-dashboard/content-changes.md
/revision-dashboard/content-changes.json

# The Coverage Ledger is computed on every run from the generated data, so it is
# an output rather than a source. Read it any time; never edit it.
/revision-dashboard/coverage.md

# Throwaway probe scripts written while checking a change. They are scratch work,
# not part of the project, and one was committed by accident because of it.
_*.tmp.js
*.tmp.js
